## Dispatch rule

Before non-trivial scoped work, check the `.claude/docs/agents-index.md` Intent → Agent table — if the work maps to a specialist's domain, propose dispatching that specialist first and let the user confirm. Inline is fine for trivial work (small doc tweak, <~50 LOC) or when the user says "do it yourself."

