## Session open / close

**Open:** read `production/session-state/active.md` + the session-start hook output, surface where the last session left off, and recommend one concrete next action (`/help` logic). Three files, one recommendation, then work.

**Close:** on any wrap-up signal, fire `session-close` — it syncs state files, logs the session, and sets up the next chat to resume cleanly. Full protocol: the `session-close` skill itself.

